{"generated": "2026-08-19 16:32", "brief": "<b>1. 글로벌 테크 및 로봇 기업의 IPO 추진</b>\n중국 메모리 반도체 기업 양쯔메모리(YMTC)가 상장 전 검수를 마치고 내년 상반기 상장을 목표로 속도를 내고 있으며, 인공지능(AI) 스타트업 앤트로픽은 IPO를 앞두고 창립자 경영권 보호를 위한 차등의결권 도입과 대규모 신용공여 한도 확보를 추진하고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1tQmhNRkVwWkxKMGgtMTFqQVkzMDR2LXNKUjdKUEVfdXh2VVVEcG1sMkVlT2VMYm5YWHJBaFRCV3puUHJvRFBLaWswVGhqd1VGdWdqVlJIRnIwUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE1JOWdXcE5BYlRRUW9XQ0tGMzlIQ2oxbFZ2YlA1QVc1VDlqMEYtSTdaazRRdDd2ckhZazJycHJlSWVqSEt5aW94WmNaclcxTjZGbGJwTm9lT0Q4VWxNOGtncUxrZ3NuSTJROXc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#19</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE81dHdmRkpwUGpKZkZxcDNGemVoLVlUX0RrUUM2OHViMlFLS3VTUVBXUTRlczJpZkhUblU3QUk2UmVBLVFpZ2NqcWZyNnQtNHR3dFZkd2pUcUNUdw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#32</a>]. 또한 중국 로봇 기업 유니트리가 상장 첫날 급등하며 시장의 주목을 받은 가운데, 체리의 로봇 부문도 해외 경찰 로봇 시장 겨냥과 함께 IPO를 추진 중입니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE5URU0wX0dHS2ZVNTV5d0JMZXllTUJpVHBKdHI5aEJCX19GZUxmTXl6eVV4U0NSS0lqMnhoZXUxMER3dE1OM2tWd2daNjR3d1lmdDNSX1pOX1BuZkk4dl9mN1B1ZXlCSEE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#18</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBLck9xeTNLTFdZVzlPQ01YcVFSRm1yUWhKYTd6RjFCcTRvdHVNaDNmSWlwRVFBaDMydnl2dC1ndDA3QXJibllKZE0yWE1kR2s?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE1uYjdnb200c2RtTWRfZC1YbTlIZlVUaGdlN1FBMkM3amwza2w3a3hGY2xyeFNKWS00WnBoNXpjN3FZRU91WGU0d0oyOVZESUIxaW5mUW9Ob0ZCTS0wc0d0N0t1MXc5Umlt?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPWDltcUN6cVpoZmN0dnRNYUpBUDF3LTVMOEM4OVNMTENDUUFFS3R4R3hDMFJBZ2M1RFk0OHlqNURabVZyMEtCTGhKWjhacnU0aWh2cTZablM4WDdjOEtHT3E4R2gxYVA2dXlFeXBUMnE3N21ZdGFNMUhCTn